[h2]Build 0.9.26[/h2]
[h3]Fixed[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Wrong colours on the pieces redrawn in 0.9.25.[/b] That build shipped the new shapes for the kitchen, wardrobes, shelving, bookcases and swings without their matching colour maps, so the material colour landed on the wrong parts: worktops, basins and hobs could take the wood or steel colour, and cabinet fronts could stay plain. The colour maps now match the art.
[*]The sectional's backs and arms now show the height strip along their near edge that 0.9.25 described, and the conversation pit seats pick up the same correction.
[/list]
[list]
[*]Art only: no gameplay changes. Safe to update mid-save.
[/list]
